## 2. Why Reduce Large-Cap United States Weighting

Large-cap United States equities dominate the S&P 500 itself, so a portfolio heavily weighted toward the same names will behave like the benchmark it is trying to beat. Research on small caps and emerging markets shows more dispersion, more inefficiency, and more room for a systematic model to add value. [ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws](https://ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws.com/web/direct-files/attachments/69907857/4ebbb313-a481-418d-b8fc-0b74c5e1caaf/config.py?AWSAccessKeyId=ASIA2F3EMEYEW4PYGNJA&Signature=k63P5vcblTPCUmtHXDfId1B7cxs%3D&x-amz-security-token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEIv%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLWVhc3QtMSJIMEYCIQD%2BQzZSHBwz7eGQuGikpqO4aMXjSm5GwZeSWagm7X4zrAIhAKadriChpDVQc0d3%2BPVc%2Fiw1N4Qkb97J1NbopAExgemMKvMECFMQARoMNjk5NzUzMzA5NzA1IgzuvCK1h%2FDBnhaVRxQq0ARqfHREdc57UQgfJZr%2F68TZrTOPfU1umlWExSuvYswtKDVV%2B2P8eBwcFSF1Q3XcyYWKLfwEuA2nOXKIk2AS9F4D5Sr6BR5EOhrJa5y4ZEBbvCjnLCgeMh5K9QigsaJb85lqDoHvxrS8tq2Q5lPDTWb55V7%2Fl6uWpNMuPJf6Z6t2GQguBraIrCRcPhuPiS0kn6UXpatytwDz4bp3eaqPPTrrFe0jxAb5EtX0LWo94QGDuJ11gKhzhkOpDMbu%2F%2FKWOhqAlxf%2B%2B4RebcmMV1Vn3uJHiHlaEUEOrk89Y%2B3vDdc%2FH64WBhqkBQWsJuJPhJORreN8WtX%2Fqj5HloU1W4fM1OtjA4ty1Zswlb%2Bz92B%2B6WM2ghld2beUO5o%2Bc6%2B3L34%2FYcXu5sIH2EolGlanhkZqRmN527DYD9C8WzmJ6X%2F0Kcs2s9lkGpuZOccH3boOI2s1206WK7XIt6ui6F2KsAYnJIbikbSEsR2ZWI1C6L7jo04qUC%2B9m%2BPcwZw9tOSYPUhtuTm0GpfoE8HStuDWB7FFDgX45JfY9Vpi2K9qrtvu%2FWAeApE649OYN%2FX7Whefg05WbKHfIZXUd1hW24gx529QOdC6E1S65Z1oPfTMQgOk3OMdLTBJ%2BeLm06HYR%2B0t4pkbL%2Bara%2BfjwQqsbYW9oTkvACGSymk0siJlknwuucf9kwXGmI5ftVlTPFuCD%2FTKGGaotmB0DE37GnsfBE294na6K8zexDXJQM81DlEN5jPBLYJeJXndcSglqhafRH3A7JLQ0RyUv59CMbDQxalA%2BTPFC4SZMODAntMGOpcB4bFOSHSxbYv0%2FslNmINQ%2BysZEsAPG3U8NxP48Mol9atNeSaWgwiNTYTDzWVgKbR95ccq6gOWeIk55R%2F6VuEj9wmdAvB1iVEeUoGcujh9B3HDD1h%2BX2hue5%2BqKf5VmlM9Le3YapPPXq0aGd3ySeD97eeba8EWeftEc2nBA4gJNozJp8yiwEj1nvK5yFnTV9TrZ0sX8Pm%2B%2FA%3D%3D&Expires=1785179699)

