## 5. Entry Logic Reference

The documented "healthy pullback within an uptrend" entry logic is:

- Positive 12-month trailing return.
- Price within a defined percentage of its 52-week high (not at the absolute peak).
- Price above its long-term moving average (200-day).
- Relative Strength Index inside a pullback band (roughly 25 to 55), not oversold/crash territory.
